      "content": "<div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f7b48ab4-9fc6c80c-ab0e-4c8d-8884-b412f061d5f9&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f7b48ab4-9fc6c80c-ab0e-4c8d-8884-b412f061d5f9\" alt=\"announcements_EN.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Hello Daevas,</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">We will be performing our scheduled game server maintenance soon.&nbsp;During the maintenance, the game login will be temporarily unavailable.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><u><strong>Details:</strong></u></div><div class=\"tableWrapper\"><table class=\"_2CAsiFd9UHbUOqzd0e7ioe _1CtoyG6UPAlYp7PCGLXx8L\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 151px;\"><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><th data-colwidth=\"151\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">When:</div></th><td class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">October 20, 2026 at 23h30 PDT / October 21, 2026 at 08h30 CEST</div></td></tr><tr><th data-colwidth=\"151\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">​Duration:</div></th><td class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">5.5 hours</div></td></tr><tr><th data-colwidth=\"151\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Affected Services:</div></th><td class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Game servers</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Details of the update will be shared at a later time.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><u><strong>Additional Notices:</strong></u></div><ul><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Once maintenance begins, you will be disconnected from the game.</div></li></ul><ul><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">The maintenance schedule and details are subject to change at any time. Any changes will be announced as an update via this notice.</div></li></ul><div data-contents-type=\"text\">&nbsp;Thank you!</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f7b49ad6-e49a7dc9-efed-4d9d-be11-4a6cfa3df385&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f7b49ad6-e49a7dc9-efed-4d9d-be11-4a6cfa3df385\" alt=\"Bottom banner.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div>"
